    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for all frame references. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a common interface for all frame references used in the astrodynamics library. It allows for easy conversion between different coordinate state/frames. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
